{"scene_id": "s00885", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00885.fountain", "heading": "EXT. JUNKYARD - BURNED-OUT SCHOOL BUS CLUBHOUSE - LATE AFTERNOON", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "TEDDY LOWELL", "names": ["TEDDY LOWELL", "TEDDY"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 19}, {"id": 1, "name": "PEDRO SALAZAR", "names": ["PEDRO SALAZAR", "PEDRO"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 2, "name": "RUTHIE KWAN", "names": ["RUTHIE KWAN", "RUTHIE"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 12}, {"id": 3, "name": "DANNY FITZGERALD", "names": ["DANNY FITZGERALD", "DANNY"], "gender": "m", "first": 8, "spoke": 16}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. JUNKYARD - BURNED-OUT SCHOOL BUS CLUBHOUSE - LATE AFTERNOON", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Summer, 1974.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Heat shimmers over a hill of stripped sedans.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Inside the long skeleton of a yellow bus, someone has laid down carpet scraps, strung Christmas lights, and nailed a Beatles poster to the ceiling.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The seats have been pulled out and replaced with milk crates.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "TEDDY LOWELL, 15, a girl with scabbed knees and a pencil behind her ear, sprawls on a crate with a notebook in her lap.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "PEDRO SALAZAR, 16, lean and quiet, tinkers with a transistor radio.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "RUTHIE KWAN, 14, perched on the driver's seat, spins the big steering wheel with one finger.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "DANNY FITZGERALD, 17, the oldest, leans in the doorway, thumbs hooked in his belt loops, a pack of cigarettes just visible in his sock.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "The radio crackles and settles on a pop song.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "They all pause to listen.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Okay. Official meeting of the Wheel Club. Everybody sit.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm already sitting.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Everybody who isn't Ruthie, sit.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll stand.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You always stand.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's why I'm taller.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's because he can't fit on the crates.", "name": "PEDRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Say that again.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You can't fit on the crates.", "name": "PEDRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Danny laughs and ruffles his hair.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Pedro ducks, grinning.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Item one. The summer plan.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We have a plan?", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We have a list.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Read it.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "One. Paint the bus. Two. Get the radio working. Three. Finish the map of the junkyard so nobody gets lost. Four. Never tell anyone about the bus.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Five. Eat.", "name": "PEDRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Five. Eat.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Six. Don't get arrested.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That one's implied.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What about the thing in the back?", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "The room goes quiet.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "The radio hisses between stations.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Danny glances at the door.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Pedro puts down his screwdriver.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which thing?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You know which thing.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We said we weren't going to talk about it.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said. I didn't say.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ruthie.", "name": "PEDRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's been there since June. Someone has to say it.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a trunk. It's an old trunk.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It has a lock.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lots of trunks have locks.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It has a lock and it's NEW.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who put a new lock on an old trunk?", "name": "PEDRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody answers.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Teddy closes her notebook with a small, careful click.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks around the bus as if seeing it for the first time, her eyes catching on each face before settling on Danny.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Danny.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What?", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've been here more than anyone.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's my brother's yard. I'm supposed to be here.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is the trunk yours?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it your brother's?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Teddy.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it?", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't know what's in it.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That isn't what I asked.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "He crosses the bus in three long strides and drops to a crouch beside the trunk, his back to them.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "His hand rests on the lock.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Pedro stands.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Ruthie slides down from the driver's seat.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "For a moment nobody breathes.", "para": 6, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He asked me to keep it safe. That's all he said. Keep it safe, don't open it, don't tell anyone.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["not turning"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you told us.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I didn't tell you. You found out.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because you left the key where Ruthie could find it.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I never did.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was under the radio.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["very small"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "He turns, finally.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "His face, that easy older-brother face, has gone grey as the road.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at Ruthie, at the key in her palm, at the three of them standing close together in the strung-up lights.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Give me the key.", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ruthie--", "name": "DANNY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're the Wheel Club. We decide together.", "name": "RUTHIE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She's right.", "name": "PEDRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Open it, Ruthie.", "name": "TEDDY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Ruthie steps forward, fits the key, turns it.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "The lock pops.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "The lid swings up on rusted hinges and a hush falls over the bus as the afternoon light finds what is inside: not money, not guns, not anything they imagined, but row upon row of school photographs, hundreds of them, each of a child they know from town, each with a name written on the back in careful pencil, and on top, a single Polaroid of the four of them, taken that very morning, through the bus window, from outside.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}